/**
 * Pure unit tests for InvoicingService.invoiceWonOpportunities().
 *
 * No DML, no SOQL and no callouts are performed:
 *  - the billing gateway is mocked with ApexMocks where the interaction only has to return a
 *    value, and is replaced by an explicit, callout free stub where it has to throw a
 *    BillingException (ApexMocks can only stub return values, not exceptions),
 *  - the selector is mocked and injected through Application.Selector.setMock, so the real
 *    OpportunitiesSelector never queries anything,
 *  - the unit of work is mocked and injected through Application.UnitOfWork.setMock, so nothing
 *    is ever committed to the database,
