            AccountId = accountId,
            Name = 'Test Opportunity',
            StageName = stageName,
            Amount = amount
        );
    }

    private static void verifyAuthenticate(IBillingGateway gatewayMock, Integer expectedCalls) {
        ((IBillingGateway) mocks.verify(gatewayMock, expectedCalls)).authenticate();
    }

    private static void verifyCreateInvoice(IBillingGateway gatewayMock, Id accountId, Decimal amount, Integer expectedCalls) {
        String ignoredInvoiceNumber =
            ((IBillingGateway) mocks.verify(gatewayMock, expectedCalls)).createInvoice(accountId, amount);
    }

    private static void verifyRegisterDirty(SObject record, Integer expectedCalls) {
        ((fflib_ISObjectUnitOfWork) mocks.verify(uowMock, expectedCalls)).registerDirty(record);
    }

